{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "framework": "playwright",
  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/pdp/verify-group-product-details-on-pdp.spec.ts > Webstore - PDP > verify group product details on pdp",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest searches the webstore for a grouped product by SKU, opens its PDP and validates the header details, highlights, 'Starting at' price, three tiered offers, the group products table (child SKU, inventory, warehouse, price), the required checkbox and dropdown add-on groups with their options, and the info tabs. Read-only; nothing is added to the cart.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Search for the grouped product SKU and open the first result.",
      "Assert image, breadcrumb Home/<category>/<name>, wishlist heart, product name, SKU, brand and short description.",
      "Assert the Free Shipping and WaterSense highlights, the 'Starting at' price and the three tiered special offers.",
      "Assert the group table headers Product, Price, Quantity and, per child product, its SKU, inventory text, warehouse address, default warehouse name, price and quantity input.",
      "Assert the 'Add-on options' heading, the required checkbox add-on group label and its options, the 'Select Add-on *' label and the dropdown option list.",
      "Assert Print, See More and Email a Friend buttons; assert the Details, Specifications and Shipping Info tab panels and open Reviews."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "brand",
      "category",
      "warehouse",
      "store"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [],
    "assertions": [
      "Breadcrumb, heading, SKU:<sku>, Brand:<brand> and short description match the grouped product.",
      "'Starting at' price equals the lowest child price.",
      "Three tiered offers show 'Buy N or more', '$<price>/item' and 'Save <discount>%'.",
      "Group table lists each child SKU with inventory text, warehouse address and name, and price.",
      "Checkbox add-on group 'Checkbox *' shows its four options; the 'Select Add-on *' dropdown options equal the recorded list.",
      "Details, Specifications and Shipping Info panels contain the recorded texts."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'verify group product details on pdp' and the six step labels match the flow; guest storageState; no linked AIO cases.",
      "All data comes from loadData(GroupDataSchema, rawData, ...) (spec line 42).",
      "Profile: SKU z-1234599 FOUND as GroupedProduct, active, PRODUCTION, brand Nibco, inventory 100000, storefrontProductIndex 1, requiredAddOnCount 2; the four child SKUs are FOUND active SimpleProducts.",
      "Params: minAddOns 2 because the PDP must show two required add-on groups (data.addOnOptionType 'Checkbox *' and the 'Select Add-on *' dropdown; profile requiredAddOnCount 2, and the key needs requiredAddOnCount <= minAddOns); addOnDisplayType CheckBox for the checkbox group. The key takes one display type, so the second (DropDown) group is not constrained. minPersonalizableAttributes 0 (no personalisation asserted). The test selects nothing.",
      "selectAddOnOptions.0 'Select' is the dropdown placeholder text (expected-output), not product data.",
      "Gap: PRODUCT_GROUPED_IN_STOCK returns only sku, name, productId, price, addOnProductId, addOnName, child1Sku. The asserted category, brand, short description, starting price, tier offers, child table (four children with prices), add-on option labels and tab texts have no output.",
      "Data in code: page object test ids lblAddOnGroupCheckbox and lblAddOnGroupSelectAddOn carry the add-on group names (Checkbox, Select Add-on); highlight selectors imgFreeShipping / imgWatersenseEpaCertified are product highlights not in the JSON.",
      "migrate: data only through loadData, but expected values depend on the recorded product (starting price, tier prices and discounts, child prices, add-on option labels with prices, descriptions), and the add-on group names are in page-object selectors.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Header and tabs -> product: productSKU sku, productName name, productCategory categoryPath, productBrand brandName, productShortDescription shortDescription, startingPrice startingPrice ('Starting at: $' + amount), addOnOptionType ('Checkbox *', required group) addOnGroupName, productDetails details, productShippingInfo shippingInfo. Supersedes the Gap line on PRODUCT_GROUPED_IN_STOCK outputs.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Tier offers specialOffer.buyQty1..3 / offerPrice1..3 -> product.tier1..3Qty / tier1..3Price (tiers by quantity).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Not produced: specialOffer.offerDiscount1..3 (percent saved) stay role data without output: they are derived from the price and the tier price, so the spec should compute them (round((price - tierNPrice) / price * 100)).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: groupProductDetails.0..3 -> product.child1..4*: productName childNName, productSKU childNSku, productPrice childNSalesPrice (shown price: sales, else childNRetailPrice), productWarehouseName childNInventory (first entry of 'warehouse=qty|...'), productInventory inStockMessage. The recorded rows are not in SKU order; if the PDP order differs from the key's child order, the spec should check each child row by SKU (presence), not by position.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Not produced: groupProductDetails.N.productWarehouseAddress (masked) stays role data without output.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: addOnOptions.0..2 ('<name>(+$<price>)') -> product.addOnName / addOn2Name / addOn3Name with the addOn*Price outputs.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Not produced: addOnOptions.3 (fourth checkbox option) stays role data without output: the key returns three add-ons; the spec should check the first three (or presence), not the full list.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Dropdown add-on group: selectAddOnOptions.1..2 ('<name>(+$<price>)') -> product.selectAddOn1Name / selectAddOn2Name with selectAddOn1Price / selectAddOn2Price; the group label 'Select Add-on *' (was expected-output) -> product.selectAddOnGroupName, role data (' *' marks the required group). selectAddOnOptions.0 'Select' stays expected-output (placeholder).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: productSpecifications.0..4 ('<label> - <value>' lines) -> product.specifications (one HTML value; the five lines are its items)."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_GROUPED_IN_STOCK",
      "alias": "product",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "quantityUsed": 1,
        "minAddOns": 2,
        "addOnDisplayType": "CheckBox",
        "minPersonalizableAttributes": 0
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 0,
        "required": false
      }
    }
  ],
